# Stratus Project - Cursor Rules

You are working on **Stratus**, Rainfall Health's data intelligence and media platform for the CMS TEAM model and bundled payments.

## Architecture
- **Framework**: Quarto Website (`project: type: website` configured in `_quarto.yml`)
- **Output Directory**: `_site/`
- **Hosting**:
  - Live on Firebase Hosting (`stratus-510519.web.app`)
  - Live on GitHub Pages (`https://artometrics.github.io/stratus/`)
- **Key Sections**:
  - `index.qmd`: Platform overview, featured media, and state whitepaper links
  - `media.qmd`: Filterable media index matching Screenshot 1 (`[All]`, `[Podcast]`, `[Report]`)
  - `articles/*.qmd`: 48+ converted executive research articles with 2-column layout and sticky right-hand "Featured" sidebar (Screenshots 2-4)
  - `states/`: State whitepapers with live CMS baseline data (California has full audio narration player + R graphics)
  - `regions/`: Regional deep dives (Northeast, NorCal & Rockies, South & Midwest, SoCal & Gulf)
  - `newsletter/`: Targeted investigative briefs (e.g. Modesto, One-Hospital Towns, CJR history)

## Key Commands
- `npm run preview` or `quarto preview`: Run local development server with hot reload
- `npm run build` or `quarto render`: Compile entire static website into `_site/`
- `npm run convert` or `python3 tools/convert_articles.py`: Sync & re-generate `.qmd` articles and `media.qmd`
- `npm run deploy`: Deploy static site to Firebase Hosting

## Design System (`styles/stratus-media.css`)
- **Brand Colors**:
  - Primary Blue: `#2b62e7` (`--color-brand-blue`)
  - Navy: `#1e293b` (`--color-brand-navy`)
  - Light Sky: `#eff6ff` (`--color-brand-sky`)
  - Gray Border: `#e2e8f0` (`--color-brand-gray-200`)
- **Typography**: `DM Sans`, -apple-system, sans-serif
- **Article Layout**:
  - `.blog-article-grid`: 2-column layout (Left: content, Right: sticky `.blog-featured` sidebar)
  - Author bylines use circular badges (`.author-avatar` + `.author-chip`)
  - Embeds use responsive Transistor FM and YouTube containers
